{"title":"2019 OIM Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find all polynomials <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/f/6efaaf74e576202fad965134bc49c6a34aac4c30.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> of degree <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897470a282b6b85fa5221eacd41369b9a157f491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" /> with integer coefficients such that for every real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> it holds\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/6/d96eff08a8d37082d15a7ef20323292c7d1b3d2c.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[P(x) = (x - P(0))(x - P(1))(x - P(2))\\cdots(x - P(n - 1))\\]\" width=\"458\" height=\"18\" />\n</p><p>~translated into English by Tomas Diaz. ~orders@tomasdiaz.com\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><i>This problem needs a solution. If you have a solution for it, please help us out by <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2019_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">adding it</a></span>.</i>  \nAssume\n</p><p>P(x)=\\prod_{k=0}^{n-1}(x-P(k))\n</p><p>If , it is easy to check that the only solution is\n</p><p>P(x)=x.\n</p><p>Now let .\n</p><p>Setting ,\n</p><p>P(0)=(-1)^n P(0)P(1)\\cdots P(n-1).\n</p><p>(-1)^n=P(1)P(2)\\cdots P(n-1).\n</p><p>If some , then substituting  gives\n</p><p>1=P(i)=\\prod_{j=0}^{n-1}(i-P(j)),\n</p><p>P(x)=(x-P(0))(x+1)^{\\,n-1}.\n</p><p>Now substitute&#160;:\n</p><p>-1=P(1)=2^{\\,n-1}(1-P(0)),\n</p><p>So\n</p><p>P(x)=x(x-P(1))(x-P(2))\\cdots(x-P(n-1)).\n</p><p>Setting ,\n</p><p>1-P(1)=\\prod_{j=2}^{n-1}(1-P(j))\\cdot(1-P(1)).\n</p><p>If , then some  for , and substituting  again gives a contradiction.\n</p><p>If , then\n</p><p><br />\n(1-P(2))\\cdots(1-P(n-1))=-2.\n</p><p>P(x)=x^2(x-2)(x-3)\\cdots,\n</p><p>Hence all cases for  are impossible.\n</p><p>Therefore the only polynomial satisfying the relation is\n</p><p>\\boxed{P(x)=x}.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2019_OIM_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=OIM_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"OIM Problems and Solutions\">OIM Problems and Solutions</a>\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018011413\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.014 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.029 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 36/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 423/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 4/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 730/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.327      1 Template:Solution\n100.00%    6.327